give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"The Midnight Oasis\"", "italic": true, "color": "light_purple"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Noble", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 3 players, 1 and only 1 of which is evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Balloonist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn a player of a different character type than last night. [+0 or +1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Snake Charmer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose an alive player: a chosen Demon swaps characters & alignments with you & is then poisoned."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Savant", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach day, you may visit the Storyteller to learn 2 things in private: 1 is true & 1 is false."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Amnesiac", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know what your ability is. Each day, privately guess what it is: you learn how accurate you are."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Engineer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose which Minions or which Demon is in play."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Huntsman", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose a living player: the Damsel, if chosen, becomes a not-in-play Townsfolk. [+the Damsel]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Professor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night*, choose a dead player: if they are a Townsfolk, they are resurrected."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fisherman", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, during the day, visit the Storyteller for some advice to help your team win."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Farmer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you die at night, an alive good player becomes a Farmer."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Poppy Grower", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nMinions & Demons do not know each other. If you die, they learn who each other are that night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Cannibal", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou have the ability of the recently killed executee. If they are evil, you are poisoned until a good player dies by execution."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Atheist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nThe Storyteller can break the game rules, and if executed, good wins, even if you are dead. [No evil characters]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Damsel", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nAll Minions know a Damsel is in play. If a Minion publicly guesses you (once), your team loses."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Drunk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know you are the Drunk. You think you are a Townsfolk character, but you are not."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Golem", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou may only nominate once per game. When you do, if the nominee is not the Demon, they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Barber", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you died today or tonight, the Demon may choose 2 players (not another Demon) to swap characters."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mezepheles", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou start knowing a secret word. The 1st good player to say this word becomes evil that night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Poisoner", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a player: they are poisoned tonight and tomorrow day."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Pit-Hag", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player & a character they become (if not in play). If a Demon is made, deaths tonight are arbitrary."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Psychopath", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach day, before nominations, you may publicly choose a player: they die. If executed, you only die if you lose roshambo."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Al-Hadikhia", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, you may choose 3 players (all players learn who): each silently chooses to live or die, but if all live, all die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Vigormortis", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. Minions you kill keep their ability & poison 1 Townsfolk neighbor. [-1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Sentinel", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nThere might be 1 extra or 1 fewer Outsider in play."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Spirit of Ivory", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nThere can't be more than 1 extra evil player."]],title:"The Midnight Oasis Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "The Midnight Oasis Script", "italic": false, "color": "light_purple", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"The Midnight Oasis\"", "italic": false, "color": "light_purple"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]